1
00:02:06,105 --> 00:02:06,855
Xu?

2
00:02:07,574 --> 00:02:08,529
Xu, why are you here?

3
00:02:09,007 --> 00:02:09,757
Xu!

4
00:02:09,906 --> 00:02:10,799
I'm okay.

5
00:02:11,571 --> 00:02:12,521
I don't remember.

6
00:02:13,244 --> 00:02:13,994
Oh...

7
00:02:14,494 --> 00:02:16,176
I was looking into Lin Jianhe's case.

8
00:02:17,227 --> 00:02:18,327
It led me to this lab.

9
00:02:18,838 --> 00:02:20,202
I came in and got knocked out.

10
00:02:20,495 --> 00:02:21,813
Xu, do you know where we are?

11
00:02:23,202 --> 00:02:23,952
This...

12
00:02:24,473 --> 00:02:25,223
Oh, right.

13
00:02:25,532 --> 00:02:26,282
You...

14
00:02:26,655 --> 00:02:27,842
Switch on that power cabinet.

15
00:02:27,842 --> 00:02:28,644
Quick!

16
00:02:34,727 --> 00:02:35,477
There.

17
00:02:35,871 --> 00:02:37,221
That's better.

18
00:02:37,482 --> 00:02:38,232
Remember

19
00:02:38,626 --> 00:02:40,626
Professor Jing Yubin's lab I mentioned?

20
00:02:41,444 --> 00:02:42,194
This is it.

21
00:02:43,117 --> 00:02:44,042
This...

22
00:02:44,897 --> 00:02:46,147
Professor Jing built this

23
00:02:46,740 --> 00:02:48,240
as a replica

24
00:02:48,583 --> 00:02:49,674
of Tesla's time machine.

25
00:02:49,812 --> 00:02:50,962
A time machine?

26
00:02:50,962 --> 00:02:51,437
Yes.

27
00:02:51,437 --> 00:02:52,187
Xu, are you mad?

28
00:02:52,588 --> 00:02:53,613
Think what you like.

29
00:02:55,172 --> 00:02:56,222
Listen.

30
00:02:56,444 --> 00:02:58,169
It's our only way out of here.

31
00:02:58,169 --> 00:02:59,744
Start it up. Now.

32
00:03:02,927 --> 00:03:03,710
Check the time.

33
00:03:03,710 --> 00:03:06,357
February 14, 2019. Four p.m.

34
00:03:06,677 --> 00:03:08,541
Weishi, I'll set mine to the same time.

35
00:03:08,541 --> 00:03:09,291
Hey.

36
00:03:09,793 --> 00:03:10,604
Get out now.

37
00:03:10,604 --> 00:03:12,604
You'll be back here in a few hours.

38
00:03:12,604 --> 00:03:14,196
Find Lin Jianhe.

39
00:03:14,196 --> 00:03:15,409
She's the key to all of this.

40
00:03:15,409 --> 00:03:16,284
Here goes.

41
00:03:16,284 --> 00:03:17,034
Go!

42
00:04:26,175 --> 00:04:26,919
Find Lin Jianhe.

43
00:04:26,919 --> 00:04:28,572
She's the key to all of this.

44
00:04:36,512 --> 00:04:37,817
I'm starving.

45
00:04:37,817 --> 00:04:39,595
Shall we go for barbecue?

46
00:04:39,595 --> 00:04:41,202
That place opposite is really good.

47
00:04:53,029 --> 00:04:53,779
Honey.

48
00:04:54,427 --> 00:04:56,427
Is something bothering you today?

49
00:04:56,652 --> 00:04:57,370
Find Lin Jianhe.

50
00:04:57,370 --> 00:04:58,688
She's the key to all of this.

51
00:04:59,042 --> 00:04:59,909
Lin Jianhe.

52
00:05:00,677 --> 00:05:01,813
Hiding something from me?

53
00:05:02,351 --> 00:05:03,289
What are you doing?

54
00:05:03,516 --> 00:05:04,914
Are you hiding something from me?

55
00:05:04,914 --> 00:05:05,441
Let go!

56
00:05:05,441 --> 00:05:06,330
You're hurting me!

57
00:05:07,838 --> 00:05:08,652
Let go!

58
00:05:12,584 --> 00:05:13,919
You must uncover the truth.

59
00:05:14,070 --> 00:05:14,952
Changing our fate

60
00:05:14,952 --> 00:05:16,316
is the only way we'll survive.

61
00:05:19,581 --> 00:05:20,733
What about this failure?

62
00:05:21,504 --> 00:05:22,436
Get rid of him.

63
00:05:23,076 --> 00:05:24,830
This timeline's a lost cause anyway.

64
00:05:26,424 --> 00:05:27,768
I gave you a chance.

65
00:05:28,559 --> 00:05:30,041
You brought this on yourself.

66
00:05:36,355 --> 00:05:36,904
Excuse me...

67
00:05:36,904 --> 00:05:37,864
The wrong person?

68
00:05:37,864 --> 00:05:38,432
Oh, sorry!

69
00:05:38,432 --> 00:05:39,182
I'm sorry.

70
00:05:39,258 --> 00:05:41,594
You look just like my boyfriend.

71
00:05:47,097 --> 00:05:48,424
Hi, honey.

72
00:05:48,424 --> 00:05:49,416
Where are you?

73
00:05:50,296 --> 00:05:50,808
Listen,

74
00:05:50,808 --> 00:05:52,278
I just embarrassed myself.

75
00:05:52,472 --> 00:05:55,020
I mistook someone who looks like you

76
00:05:55,317 --> 00:05:56,998
for you. I even grabbed his arm!

77
00:05:58,538 --> 00:05:59,237
Hey!

78
00:05:59,237 --> 00:06:00,387
There you are!

79
00:06:00,974 --> 00:06:01,724
You're here!

80
00:06:03,813 --> 00:06:04,804
Wow!

81
00:06:08,644 --> 00:06:09,394
I love it.

82
00:06:09,809 --> 00:06:10,630
Let's go.

83
00:06:10,932 --> 00:06:11,605
Let's eat.

84
00:06:11,605 --> 00:06:12,355
Okay.

85
00:06:32,372 --> 00:06:34,372
If you change the past,

86
00:06:35,614 --> 00:06:37,189
the future changes with it.

87
00:06:39,533 --> 00:06:40,760
Have you made up your mind?

88
00:06:42,542 --> 00:06:43,633
Looks like my time's up.

89
00:06:44,194 --> 00:06:45,733
You're running out of time too.

